      {
        "author_name": "Mondor Bernardi",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/118260554954049675134/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLtqBCXBmBkaM0Rc9aJK6HDF0eBK5Gk1zO4ogwLEDOs2t9YAw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "6 months ago",
        "text": "Enio and his team were very professional throughout the process of selecting the right awning to suit our needs, right up to the installation team that was a pleasure to deal with.  We are very satisfied with the end result!",
        "time": 1753887105,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Kim Policarpio",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111804244850514230802/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWFPH4KiG1nH0zZFfEVd-jokZahEsrTm_roDWboxJt62geWKNA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 years ago",
        "text": "Decor Au Vent recently installed a second-hand awning at our residence.  They did an amazing job organizing all of the necessary tasks to make this happen. From finalizing the details and prompt communication from Nicole to the two technicians who not only went to pick up the awning from its original owners (which saved us time and money) but also installed the awning. They were both very courteous, knowledgeable and took care to clean up after they were done.\nThank you again for making the process very easy and painless. We have no hesitation recommending you to others.",
